Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 02:18:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(gov): reconcile R11/D-015/R5 and record D-016
 adaptive screener

Bring the R11 screener requirement, D-015 Timeback-fit reframe, and the R5
capability-and-fit standard onto this branch, then add D-016: build the R11
screener as a born-synthetic adaptive test that supplements (not replaces) the
D-014 external-CogAT path. Register feature IDs AX-01..AX-06 and work item
TECH-004. All synthetic, validated=false; no live launch.
